  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/second-temple-judaism/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Luke 4:16-21, what does Jesus do \"as was his custom\" on the Sabbath, and what does that tell us about his own Jewish practice?" .
