<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/babylonian-exile#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/babylonian-exile/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/babylonian-exile/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "According to 2 Kings 24:10-16 and 25:8-12, who was taken to Babylon in each deportation, and who was left behind in the land?" .
