  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/babylonian-exile/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "1 Peter 1:1 and 1:17 call Christians foreigners and exiles. Where do you feel \"away from home\" in your own life or church, and what would it look like to seek the peace of the place where God has put you?" .
