<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Exodus 19:4-6, what does God remind Israel he has already done, and what does he say they will become if they keep his covenant?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Why do the people ask Moses to speak to them instead of God (Exodus 20:18-21; Deuteronomy 5:23-27)? What does Moses say the fear is meant to do?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What happens with the blood in Exodus 24:6-8, and how do Jesus's words over the cup in Mark 14:24 echo Moses' words?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Deuteronomy 5:3 tells a later generation that the covenant was made \"with us\". In what sense does a story that happened long ago become your story too?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/giving-of-the-law-at-sinai/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Hebrews 12:18-24 contrasts Sinai with Mount Zion. How should both the holiness of Sinai and the welcome of Zion shape the way you come to God in worship?" .
