<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Psalm 22:1-2 the psalmist says God does not answer. Whom is he still speaking to, and what does it mean that he calls God \"my God\"?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What does the psalmist remember in verses 4-5 and 9-10? How do those memories help him keep praying?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Find the point where the psalm turns from plea to praise. How far does the praise reach by verses 27-31?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compare Psalm 22:7-8 and 22:18 with Matthew 27:35, 39 and 43 and John 19:23-24. What do the Gospel writers want readers to notice?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Jesus prays the first line of this psalm from the cross (Mark 15:34). How does knowing the whole psalm shape the way you hear his cry?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is there a time when you felt God was far away? What would it look like to pray that honestly, as this psalm does?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22/check/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22> .
