  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "My God, my God, why have you forsaken me?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/psalm-22> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Psalm 21 (Greek and Latin numbering)" .
