  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sadducees-question-about-the-resurrection/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Which law of Moses do the Sadducees build their question on (compare Mark 12:19 with Deuteronomy 25:5-6), and what was that law meant to protect?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sadducees-question-about-the-resurrection/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sadducees-question-about-the-resurrection> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sadducees-question-about-the-resurrection/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sadducees-question-about-the-resurrection/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Jesus says the Sadducees know neither \"the Scriptures nor the power of God\" (Mark 12:24). Which part of his answer addresses each of those two mistakes?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sadducees-question-about-the-resurrection/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sadducees-question-about-the-resurrection> .
