<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Who is listening when Jesus begins to teach in Matthew 5:1-2, and who is listening when he finishes in Matthew 7:28-29? Why might both groups matter?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Matthew 5:17-20, what does Jesus say he came to do with the Law and the Prophets?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Read the three examples of \"secret\" devotion in Matthew 6:1-18 (giving, prayer, fasting). What do they have in common, and which one most challenges your own habits?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount> .
