  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/sermon-on-the-mount/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The sermon ends with two builders (Matthew 7:24-27). What is the difference between them, and what would \"doing\" one of these teachings look like for you or your group this week?" .
