  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/loving-your-neighbor/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Read Leviticus 19:9-18. Which concrete actions does the chapter list before it reaches \"love your neighbor as yourself,\" and what do they show about what love means there?" .
