  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/loving-your-neighbor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "What Scripture says to Christians asking how to treat the people around them: the command of Leviticus 19:18 to love one's neighbor as oneself, which Jesus set beside love for God as the heart of the law, widened through the parable of the Good Samaritan and the call to love enemies, and which the apostles called the fulfilment of the law." .
