  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Psalm 13 asks \"How long?\" four times in two verses. What changes in verses 5-6, and has the psalmist's situation changed by then?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament> .
