  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Psalm 88 ends in darkness, without a turn to praise. Why might God have included a prayer like this in Scripture?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament> .
