  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Job 42:7-8, God says the friends did not speak rightly about him \"as my servant Job has.\" What had the friends said, and what had Job done?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Jesus prays the opening words of Psalm 22 from the cross (Matthew 27:46). How does knowing the whole psalm shape the way you hear his cry?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/suffering-and-lament> .
