<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Read Psalm 100:3 in the King James Version and in the World English Bible. How do they differ, and how does the Masoretic note about what is \"written\" and what is \"read\" explain it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Nehemiah 8:8 the Levites read the law \"distinctly\" and \"gave the sense\". How did the Masoretes' vowel signs and accents serve the same goal?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "According to Luke 4:16-17, what was Jesus handed in the synagogue at Nazareth, and what does that tell you about how Scripture was read in his day?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Why might the Masoretes have counted the verses, words and even letters of Scripture? What does that care suggest about how they regarded the text?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How does it shape your trust in the Old Testament to know that much of it reached your Bible through generations of Jewish scribes?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text/check/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/masoretic-text> .
