  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/acts-of-the-apostles/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compare Luke 1:1-4 with Acts 1:1-3. Who is addressed in both, and what does Acts say the \"former treatise\" was about?" .
