  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/gospel-of-matthew/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Matthew 1:1 calls Jesus \"the son of David, the son of Abraham.\" Why might Matthew open with those two names in particular?" .
