  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/gospel-of-matthew/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Find the sentence that closes each of the five teaching blocks (Matthew 7:28, 11:1, 13:53, 19:1 and 26:1). What does each discourse teach disciples about life in the kingdom?" .
