  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/gospels/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Paul summarises \"the gospel\" in 1 Corinthians 15:1-5. Which of those events do all four Gospels tell at length, and why do you think they give them so much space?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/gospels/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/gospels> .
