  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/gospels/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Choose one story told in more than one Gospel. Read the versions side by side. What does each writer emphasise, and what would be lost if we merged them into one account?" .
