  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Acts 9:1-6, what is Saul doing when Jesus meets him, and what question does Jesus ask him?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compare Acts 9:20-30 with Galatians 1:15-24. What does each account emphasise about what Paul did after his conversion?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul> .
