  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Philippians 3:4-8, which credentials does Paul list, and how does he now value them?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul> .
