  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/paul/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Paul calls himself \"the least of the apostles\" yet says God's grace was not in vain (1 Corinthians 15:9-10). How might his story shape the way we see people who have done harm, or our own past?" .
