<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Matthew 16:13-20, what does Peter confess about Jesus, and where does Jesus say that insight came from?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Why does Jesus rebuke Peter so sharply in Matthew 16:21-23, only moments after blessing him?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compare Jesus' warning in Luke 22:31-34 with his three questions in John 21:15-17. How does the second scene answer the first?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What did Peter learn at Joppa and in Cornelius's house (Acts 10:28, 10:34-35), and how did he use that lesson at Jerusalem (Acts 15:7-11)?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/peter/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Peter failed publicly and was restored and given work to do. Where do you, or your church, need to hear that a failure is not the end of someone's discipleship?" .
