  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/book-of-ezra> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The Old Testament book that tells how Jewish exiles returned from Babylon under the Persian king Cyrus, rebuilt the Temple in Jerusalem, and were later led by Ezra, a priest and scribe, to reorder their life around the Law of Moses; in the Hebrew Bible it forms one book with Nehemiah." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/book-of-ezra> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/scheme/old-testament-books> .
