  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/deuteronomy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The fifth book of the Bible and the last book of the Torah (Pentateuch), presented as Moses' farewell speeches to Israel on the plains of Moab, in which he recalls the covenant made at Horeb (Sinai), restates its laws, calls Israel to love the one God with all their heart, and sets before them the choice of life or death before he dies and Joshua leads them into the land." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/deuteronomy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/scheme/old-testament-books> .
