  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/genesis> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The first book of the Bible and of the Pentateuch (Torah), which tells of God's creation of the world, humanity's fall into sin and its spread, the Flood and Babel, and then God's call of Abraham and the story of his family through Isaac, Jacob and Joseph, ending with Israel's ancestors in Egypt." .
