  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/abraham> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The patriarch whom God called from Mesopotamia to Canaan with promises of land, offspring and blessing for all the families of the earth; renamed from Abram, father of Ishmael and of Isaac, he is honoured in both Testaments as the model of faith and, for Christians, the father of all who believe." .
