<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Why does Jacob receive the new name \"Israel\" in Genesis 32:28, and what does God promise him when he confirms the name in Genesis 35:9-12?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "According to Deuteronomy 7:6-9, why did God choose Israel, and what was not the reason?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What does God ask of Israel in Exodus 19:5-6, and what does he say Israel will become?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Romans 9:4-5 Paul lists the gifts that belong to the Israelites. Which of these gifts have reached you, and how might that shape the way you speak about the Jewish people?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Israel was not chosen for being large or impressive (Deuteronomy 7:7). How does it change your sense of belonging to God to know that his choice rests on love rather than merit?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites/check/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites> .
