  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/israelites> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The people descended, in the biblical account, from Jacob (renamed Israel) through his twelve sons; brought out of Egypt and bound to God by covenant at Sinai, they are the chosen people whose story fills the Old Testament and whose heritage Paul treasures in Romans 9–11." .
