  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What happened to Galilee in 2 Kings 15:29, and how does Isaiah 9:1-2 answer that memory of loss?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "According to Matthew 4:12-16, why did Jesus settle in Capernaum, and which prophecy does Matthew see fulfilled there?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee> .
