  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Mark 1:14-20, what is the first thing Jesus does in Galilee, and whom does he call beside the lake?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee> .
