  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "John 1:46 and John 7:52 show people doubting that anything good could come from Galilee. Why might God have chosen such an unlikely place, and where do you see him working in \"unlikely\" places today?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee> .
