  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/galilee/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "After the resurrection, the risen Jesus sends his disciples back to Galilee (Matthew 28:7-10, 16). What might it mean that the mission to \"all nations\" began from the place where they first met him?" .
