  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "According to 2 Samuel 5:6-9, who lived in Jerusalem before David, and what did David call the stronghold once he took it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem> .
