  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Read Psalm 122. Why were pilgrims glad to go up to Jerusalem, and what does the psalmist ask readers to pray for?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem> .
