  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Isaiah 2:2-4, who comes to Jerusalem in the \"latter days\", and what do they go away with?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem> .
