  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Luke 9:51 says Jesus \"intently set his face\" to go to Jerusalem, and Luke 19:41-44 shows him weeping over it. What do these two moments tell you about how Jesus regarded the city?" .
