  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Revelation 21 describes a New Jerusalem with no temple in it. What does that suggest about where God means to live, and how might that hope shape the way you worship now?" .
