  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/jerusalem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The hill city in the Judean highlands that David captured from the Jebusites and made his capital, where Solomon built the Temple; the centre of Israel's worship, the place of Jesus' death and resurrection and the starting point of the church's mission, and in the prophets and Revelation an image of God's people and his future dwelling with them." .
