  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "According to 2 Samuel 7, David wanted to build God a house. What \"house\" does God promise to build for David instead, and who will build the Temple?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In 1 Kings 8:27-30, Solomon says heaven itself cannot contain God. If that is so, what was the Temple for, according to his prayer?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In John 2:18-22, what did Jesus mean by \"this temple\", and when did his disciples finally understand it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Paul tells the Corinthian church, \"ye are the temple of God\" (1 Corinthians 3:16, KJV). How might seeing your congregation, and not only a building, as God's dwelling change the way you treat one another?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-temple> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-17"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
