  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/abrahamic-covenant> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "God's covenant with Abraham in Genesis 12-22, promising him descendants, the land of Canaan and blessing for all the families of the earth, sealed by a covenant rite in Genesis 15, given the sign of circumcision in Genesis 17 and confirmed by oath in Genesis 22; the New Testament reads it as fulfilled in Christ, and Christian traditions differ on how its promises to Israel and its sign carry forward." .
