<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/grace#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/grace/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/grace/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Exodus 34:6 is God's own description of himself to Moses. Which words in it describe grace, and why is it striking that this comes right after the golden calf?" .
