  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/mosaic-covenant> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The covenant God made with Israel through Moses after the Exodus, sealed at Sinai (Exodus 19-24), renewed on the plains of Moab (Deuteronomy 29) and in later generations, binding the rescued people to the Lord with his law, the Sabbath as its sign, and blessings and curses; the prophets foresaw a new covenant, and Christian traditions differ on how its law applies to believers today." .
